      "task_key": "rain_drainage_check",
      "task_title": "Clear Drainage Outlets & Postpone Foliar Sprays",
      "task_description": "Heavy precipitation forecast detected (>15mm or >60% probability). Inspect bunds and clear excess water drainage channels.",
